uisr-f: sqrt(x) to the nearest integer, for x from 0 to 999.
Cells 43-98. To call it, load x into the accumulator and JMP 43.
It returns the nearest integer to sqrt(x) in the accumulator.
It overwrites its own cells and cell 99.
Size 56 cells. It runs at most 105 instructions, 37.4 on average, counted from cell 43 to the return jump in cell 98.
Exact over the domain.

